msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Imperial Mantle"

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Transform your soldiers into an organized and unshakable military. Focus on "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHIELD_UNIT.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FIGHTER."
"Hyperlink} with flexible military tactics."

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@AUTHOR@NAME"
msgstr "Emperor Sibbald the Diviner"

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@AUTHOR@DESC"
msgstr ""
"\"Victory in war does not depend entirely upon numbers or mere courage; only "
"skill and discipline will insure it.\""

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill1@Name"
msgstr "Company Captain"

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill1@DESC"
msgstr ""
"A {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FIGHTER.Hyperlink} that specializes in commanding "
"troops in the thick of combat."

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill1@Unit@Skill"
msgstr "Tactical Order - Hold Still!"

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill1@Unit@Skill2@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Order the units in a 1-hex cone to press forward: [bulletlist] [bullet/]+1 "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STRENGTHENED.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]+10 {GLOBAL."
"UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]This unit ends it's turn in {GLOBAL."
"DefenseModeConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill1@Unit@Skill@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Order the units in a 1-hex cone to hold their ground: [bulletlist] "
"[bullet/]Has their negative status effects removed. [bullet/]+10 {GLOBAL."
"UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]This unit ends it's turn in {GLOBAL."
"DefenseModeConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill1@Unit@Skill2"
msgstr "Tactical Order - Press On!"

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill1@Unit"
msgstr "Company Captain"

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill2@Name"
msgstr "Secondary Weapons"

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill2@SKILL@Name"
msgstr "Throw Secondary Weapon"

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill2@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Retrofit your vanguard with an additional throwable weapon: [bulletlist] "
"[bullet/]Add {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SECONDARY_WEAPONS_JAV.Hyperlink}, an {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.RANGED_UNIT.Hyperlink} ability that deals {GLOBAL."
"PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill3@Name"
msgstr "Imperial Troops"

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill3@Skill@Name"
msgstr "Ascension: Imperial Commander"

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill3@Skill@DESC"
msgstr "This unit is drilled on all forms of combat, damage increased by +20%."

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill3@Desc"
msgstr ""
"Turn your core infantry into a professional fighting force, granting them: "
"[bulletlist] [bullet/]+20% increased damage."

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill2@Unit@Skill@DESC"
msgstr "Throw your secondary weapon."

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill4@Name"
msgstr "Raise Shields"

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill4@DESC"
msgstr ""
"All {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHIELD_UNIT.Hyperlink} take a defensive stance "
"against ranged attacks for 2 turns: [bulletlist] [bullet/]A aura that gives "
"+80% Evasion. [bullet/]Original {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SHIELD_UNIT.Hyperlink} "
"are {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SLOWED.Hyperlink} for 2 turns."

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill5@Name"
msgstr "Belligerent Culture"

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill5@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Forge more vigorous people by introducing the military as a core tenet of "
"your culture: [bulletlist] [bullet/]+10 {GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink} "
"and Hitpoint Regeneration."

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill6@Name"
msgstr "Tactical Order - Regroup!"

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill6@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Order an unit to regroup at your position: [bulletlist] [bullet/]Has their "
"negative status effects removed. [bullet/]Heals for +30 {GLOBAL."
"TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]Pull target unit to a hex "
"adjacent to this one. [bullet/]This unit ends it's turn in {GLOBAL."
"DefenseModeConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@DISCIPLINE@Skill6@Group"
msgstr "Tome of Discipline Group"

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME"
msgstr ""
"Order an unit to regroup at your position: [bulletlist] [bullet/]Has their "
"negative status effects removed. [bullet/]Heals for +30 {GLOBAL."
"TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]Pull target unit to a hex "
"adjacent to this one."

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME2"
msgstr ""

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME3"
msgstr ""

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME4"
msgstr ""

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME5"
msgstr ""

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME@1"
msgstr "Commander's Voice"

msgid "TOME@DISC@PANTHEON@NAME@2"
msgstr ""
"Whenever this unit enters {GLOBAL.DefenseModeConcept.Hyperlink}: [bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]Adjacent friendly units gain 1 stack of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"REGENERATION.Hyperlink}."
